	<Folder id="5983403BE1000001">
		<name>ZA V. TN MAP</name>
		<open>1</open>
		<description><![CDATA[This map organizes locations referenced in publicly available case materials, reporting, and trial testimony related to the criminal case against Zachary Adams.<br/><br/>
  This file is an index of places mentioned in sources. Labels describe how a location is referenced (for example “reported found” or “described in testimony”). It does not determine what occurred at any location.<br/><br/>
  Coordinate precision varies. Items marked “approx.” are approximate placements based on descriptions in sources rather than surveyed points.<br/><br/>
  Some entries below now include line-referenced citations to a 2022 appellate opinion (State v. Zachary Rye Adams). Where present, citations are preserved as <b>[cite: ...]</b> line references from that document extract.<br/><br/>
  Additional reference: <a href="https://innocentbrothers.com/">innocentbrothers.com</a> (accessed 2025-12-15).<br/><br/>
  https://innocentbrothers.com/<br/><br/>
  Last updated: 2025-12-15
  ]]></description>
		<styleUrl>#__managed_style_091FA8AF7C3E8027A06F</styleUrl>
		<Folder id="5983403BE2000002">
			<name>MAJOR EVENT LABELS</name>
			<description>Large text labels with polygon outlines marking major event locations</description>
