			<Placemark id="5983403BE200001A">
				<name>JUANITA HICKERSON</name>
				<description><![CDATA[<b>Identity:</b> Late grandmother of Shayne Austin and Jason Autry. <b>[cite: 415]</b><br/>
      <b>Evidence:</b> Money and a receipt with the victim's name were found on her property. <b>[cite: 488]</b><br/>
      <b>Location detail:</b> Located about one mile from Austin's home. <b>[cite: 725]</b><br/>
      <b>Source:</b> 2022 appellate opinion (State v. Zachary Rye Adams), line refs above
      ]]></description>
